bel": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["Photorealistic DSLR photography style, 85mm portrait lens, f/1.8 shallow depth of field, warm golden-hour natural sunlight, subtle film grain, authentic skin texture with pores and soft imperfections, natural color grading, creamy bokeh, no 3D render, no illustration, no anime. Use <Picture 1> and <Picture 2> as reference frames.\nCUT 1: Eye-level medium two-shot on a sun-drenched rooftop garden at late afternoon — the girl from <Picture 1> with long flowing purple hair and white strapless crop top stands inches away from the girl from <Picture 2> with long black hair, white polo shirt and plaid tennis skirt, her racket leaning against a weathered brick wall behind them. The purple-haired girl's cheeks are flushed a natural pink, her right hand slowly rising to gently cup the black-haired girl's jaw; the black-haired girl gazes back with soft, watery eyes full of longing, her own hands releasing the hem of her skirt to reach for the purple-haired girl's waist. Real sunlight catches individual strands of their hair, creating natural rim light. The camera slowly dollies forward on a subtle track, closing the gap as romantic tension peaks, their faces inching closer frame by frame, background cityscape melting into creamy organic bokeh through the 85mm lens.\nTRANSITION: A sudden warm gust of wind blows a blinding curtain of cherry blossom petals across the lens in a soft pink-white flurry, motion-blurring the entire frame into natural creamy bokeh —\nCUT 2: Extreme intimate close-up on the kiss — their lips meet softly, eyes gently closed, the purple-haired girl's fingers now tenderly cradling the other's cheek while the black-haired girl's hand rests gently on the purple-haired girl's bare waist. Golden-hour sunlight illuminates the edges of their hair with natural halos, individual petals frozen in sharp focus around them while the city skyline melts into warm amber 